    "sillyaluminum:aluminummaking-title": "Mod Mechanic: Aluminum Making",
    "sillyaluminum:aluminummaking-text": "<strong>Aluminum Making</strong><br><i>We spent so long asking ourselves if we could, we never stopped to ask ourselves if we should</i><br><br>The best way to get aluminum is to not get aluminum. You're much better off turning around here and doing something better with your time.<br>If you insist on continuing, this is a long crafting chain following what may have been one of the processes to get aluminum out of bauxite without the need for electricity.<br><br>Probably. We're not 100% sure but a chemist friend says it might maybe probably have maybe worked once maybe.<br><br><strong>Okay But Why?</strong><br>For the most part, there isn't a good answer as to why. Mostly just bragging rights.<br>For actual uses, it does have some. The <a href=\"handbook://item-ingot-aluminum\">ingots</a> fetch a very nice price from traders, giving you quite the profit. The <a href=\"handbook://item-armor-body-chain-aluminum\">chain</a> and <a href=\"handbook://item-armor-body-plate-aluminum\">plate</a> armors, whilst not having very good protection, only demands half the sacrifices as other chain or plate armors. Finally, the <a href=\"handbook://item-blade-falx-aluminum\">aluminum falx</a> is on par with a <a href=\"handbook://item-blade-falx-steel\">steel falx</a>, though that's because the aluminum is only decorative, not the blade.<br><br><strong>Prerequisites</strong><br>Many, many resources are needed for making aluminum. Roughly in order, you'll need <a href=\"handbook://block-sillyaluminum:crop-saltwort-7\">saltwort</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-lime\">lime</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-stone-bauxite\">bauxite</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-salt\">salt</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-ore-sulfur\">sulfur</a>, <a href=\"handbook://item-sillyaluminum:ore-pyrolusite\">pyrolusite</a>, and <a href=\"handbook://item-charcoal\">charcoal</a>. You'll also need access to <a href=\"handbook://block-barrel\">barrels</a>, <a href=\"handbook://block-bloomerybase-north\">bloomeries</a>, a <a href=\"handbooksearch://quern\">quern</a>, a <a href=\"handbook://block-pulverizerframe-north\">pulverizer</a> with at least tier 2 pounder caps, and way too much time.<br><br><strong>Alternatives</strong><br>Instead of going through all the work for aluminum, you can instead buy <a href=\"handbook://item-arrow-aluminum\">arrows</a>, the <a href=\"handbook://item-blade-falx-aluminum\">falx blade</a>, and the <a href=\"handbook://item-spear-generic-ornatealuminum\">ornate spear</a> from traders (though for a VERY steep price). In fact, this is the only way to obtain the spear. If you still want the pure metal, you could try your hand at finding some <a href=\"handbook://item-nugget-nativealuminum\">native aluminum ore</a>. Good luck, as it is exceptionally hard to find!"
}